{
    "title": "Karrot: Buy & sell locally",
    "description": "<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>IT\u2019S FREE</b></font>\r\nWe don\u2019t charge you to use Karrot. What\u2019s more, you could even find free stuff. Pop in to see what\u2019s on offer, you\u2019ll find a range of items, from home decor to baby stuff!\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>WE\u2019RE LOCAL</b></font>\r\nBuy and sell with your neighbours in your community by meeting up down the road or at local spots. That means you don\u2019t have to deal with post & packaging.\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>SELLING MADE EASY</b></font>\r\nIt takes less than 30 seconds to post. Upload your old stuff or search for something you want. Simply start a chat to make a deal.\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>SAFE & SECURE</b></font>\r\nBuy and sell with verified users from your neighbourhood. We use location and mobile verification to protect our users.\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>TRUSTED RATINGS</b></font>\r\nBased on user reviews and feedback, our rating system gives you peace of mind. Each user\u2019s Karrot Rating is shown clearly in their profile.\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>CHAT SAFELY</b></font>\r\nOpen a secure private chat with sellers and buyers. We\u2019re always working to make Karrot a safe community.\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>NO PROFESSIONAL SELLERS</b></font>\r\nKarrot is made for you and your local community so we restrict ads by professional sellers.\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>NEVER MISS OUT ON A DEAL</b></font>\r\nGet notified about discounts. Favourite items by tapping the heart icon and we\u2019ll notify you when the price goes down.If you have any questions or feedback, we\u2019d love to hear it. Feel free to get in touch at help@karrotmarket.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>IT\u2019S FREE</b></font><br>We don\u2019t charge you to use Karrot. What\u2019s more, you could even find free stuff. Pop in to see what\u2019s on offer, you\u2019ll find a range of items, from home decor to baby stuff!<br><br><font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>WE\u2019RE LOCAL</b></font><br>Buy and sell with your neighbours in your community by meeting up down the road or at local spots. That means you don\u2019t have to deal with post &amp; packaging.<br><br><font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>SELLING MADE EASY</b></font><br>It takes less than 30 seconds to post. Upload your old stuff or search for something you want. Simply start a chat to make a deal.<br><br><font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>SAFE &amp; SECURE</b></font><br>Buy and sell with verified users from your neighbourhood. We use location and mobile verification to protect our users.<br><br><font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>TRUSTED RATINGS</b></font><br>Based on user reviews and feedback, our rating system gives you peace of mind. Each user\u2019s Karrot Rating is shown clearly in their profile.<br><br><font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>CHAT SAFELY</b></font><br>Open a secure private chat with sellers and buyers. We\u2019re always working to make Karrot a safe community.<br><br><font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>NO PROFESSIONAL SELLERS</b></font><br>Karrot is made for you and your local community so we restrict ads by professional sellers.<br><br><font color=\"#ff8a3d\"><b>NEVER MISS OUT ON A DEAL</b></font><br>Get notified about discounts. Favourite items by tapping the heart icon and we\u2019ll notify you when the price goes down.If you have any questions or feedback, we\u2019d love to hear it. Feel free to get in touch at help@karrotmarket.com",
